# Layer A density v4 fixture: 21-fixpoint-factorial using nested expressions.
#
# Single-statement factorial body: three intermediate APPs collapse into a
# nested expression inside IF's else branch (Agent A's Slice 10 — nested
# expressions). Type declarations and LAM param annotations are retained
# explicitly because Agent B's compact-LAM-param inference doesn't yet
# walk into nested expressions to discover the param's binder uses.
# Combining nested expressions with elision of LAM param types is a
# follow-up: have the Elaborator scan inside Arg.Nested.
#
# Round-trip: canonical hash equals 21-fixpoint-factorial.json's.
@v=1 root=app
factT FNT [intT] intT
matchBody IF (APP eqInt [n 0]) 1 (APP mul [n (APP recurse [(APP sub [n 1])])])
bodyLam LAM [recurse:factT n:intT] matchBody
fact FIX factT bodyLam
app APP fact [5]
